{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t尖沙咀發生嚴重交通意外，導致1死3傷。據了解，警方拘捕一名年約38歲男子，涉嫌危險駕駛引致他人嚴重受傷及酒後駕駛。<br/>\n<br/>\n消息表示，警員經調查後，在柯士甸道拘捕這名男子，並進行酒精呼氣測試，發現超標。<br/>\n<br/>\n下午近2時半，寶勒巷6號對開發生嚴重交通意外，一輛私家車懷疑剷上行人路，導致1死3傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:04:02.602507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:36:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:23.892298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T08:57:26.724069+00:00","content_hash":"ea634ac17b85ab0089c107c6705ed518b5d0a46fd9f833c02b7a8bb417b0d28b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}